<title>FRANCE: Alcatel SAFT, Legrand in deal.</title>
<headline>Alcatel SAFT, Legrand in deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said its SAFT unit had agreed to sell its security lighting and alarms systems division to Legrand, conditional on regulatory approval.</p>
<p>The division had 1996 sales of 380 million francs and employs 400 people in France, Spain and Australia.</p>
<p>Alcatel said the deal was part of its asset sale programme. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
